  m_Name: Permian Extinction
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TimelineEvent
  eventTimeMYA: 251
  eventName: The Permian-Triassic Extinction
  eventText: Referred to as "The Great Dying", this event was the largest extinction
    in Earth's history. 96% of species were lost and took over 10 million years to
    recover. However, the loss in many environmental niches resulted in an open path
    for the evolution of the dinosaurs.
